horizon: years
roles: colleague, boss, friend, patron
who: colleague
earth: the hospital's small ward where old patients get back on their feet is to close in the spring, and the families want you to lead the fight
scene: The small ward where old patients get back on their feet is to close in the spring, to save money. {N} has nursed there for twelve years. The families have started a fund, and they want {N} at the head of it.
scene W: Every old patient who leaves this ward walking is one who did not go straight into a home. {N} wants that for all of them.
scene U: {N} has the figures: falls, readmissions, the weeks each patient stays. They make the board's sums look wrong.
scene B: The private clinic across town is hiring, and it pays better. {N} would be a catch for them.
scene R: {N} could start shouting about this tomorrow, and plenty of the families would shout too.
scene G: Half the patients are the parents of people {N} went to school with. They are not strangers.
