- B | make a named gift to the families' fund, and sit on its committee | v: power, benevolence | lever: fund | sphere: care.B | chance: 60
- R | work every extra hour the ward needs to get through its last winter | v: benevolence, stimulation | lever: loyalty | sphere: care.R | chance: 60
