- UR | take a post at the private clinic across town, where the old patients will go | v: achievement, self-direction | lever: exit | sphere: care.UR | chance: 50
- UG | start a carers' circle where families learn the daily exercises from each other | v: benevolence, universalism | lever: found | sphere: care.GU | chance: 50
- BR | go on the evening news with what closing the ward will cost the town | v: power, stimulation | lever: voice | sphere: care.BR | chance: 50
works: The board gives the ward another three years, and the families' fund pays for its new beds.
works: The ward closes, but what it did goes on in the town, and {N} is the one people send for.
fails: The ward closes in the spring, and the first winter after it the hospital's corridors fill with trolleys.
