per_year: 0 0 0 .015 .015 .01
drivers: money-.3
times: Among people who teach in a college or university (perhaps 1 adult in 60), the classes they teach being closed for want of money comes to about 1 in 3 over a career (estimate; adult and evening classes are often cut first), set at 1 to 2 in 100 a year among them
likelier: a teacher of adult or evening classes, a college in a lean year, a town far from the city
rarer: a teacher of a popular day course, a well-endowed college
gap: 6-20
tone: trouble
