times: Among master makers in a trade with its own association, board or association (perhaps 1 adult in 100), being asked to take the post that judges apprentices and keeps the standard comes to about 1 in 4 (estimate; Sennett 2008 on how crafts keep their standards), set at 1 to 2 in 100 a year among them
