- U | accept the finding, and ask that the loose guard go in the report as well | v: universalism, security | lever: voice | pushes: institution employer | sphere: prod.U | chance: 60
- B | let it be known on the floor that half the shift skipped the check too | v: power, security | mark: made an enemy | lever: subvert | sphere: prod.B | chance: 60
- R | walk off the floor that day, and look for work at the other plant | v: self-direction, stimulation | lever: exit | sphere: prod.R | chance: 60
- G | go to see your workmate at home with your family, and say it was your fault | act: go to see their workmate at home with their family, and say it was their fault | v: tradition, benevolence | mark: owned up | lever: loyalty | sphere: prod.G | chance: 60
- WU | propose a signed check sheet for every press, every morning | v: conformity, universalism | lever: voice | sphere: prod.WU | chance: 50
- WR | tell the whole shift at break that the foreman was fair, and the check matters | v: universalism, benevolence | lever: loyalty | sphere: prod.RW | chance: 50
- UB | ask the union rep to get the warning cut to a year, on your clean record | act: ask the union rep to get the warning cut to a year, on their clean record | v: achievement, security | lever: voice | pushes: institution union | sphere: prod.UB | chance: 50
- RG | go through the motions from now on, and do only what the foreman sees | v: security, hedonism | lever: neglect | sphere: prod.RG | chance: 50
- BG | offer to train the new starters in the checks, if the warning comes off sooner | v: achievement, tradition | lever: voice | sphere: prod.BG | chance: 50
works: {N} takes the warning, keeps the check, and in three years is the one the new starters ask.
works: The inquiry's fairness sticks: the whole floor does the checks now, and nobody else is hurt.
fails: The warning follows {N} for years, and the post {N} wanted goes to someone else.
fails: The floor takes sides over the report, and {N} works the next year among people who will not speak.
